# __DISPLAY_NAME__

__DESCRIPTION__

## Development

```bash
pnpm --dir extensions/__PLUGIN_NAME__ build
node scripts/package-extension.mjs extensions/__PLUGIN_NAME__
```

## Structure

- `src/extension.ts` registers backend commands and session tree data.
- `src/ui/*.tsx` contains React surfaces.
- `scripts/build-ui.js` compiles each React surface into a self-contained HTML file under `dist/`.

MCP support is optional. Generate with `--with-mcp` when the agent needs private tool access
through MCP Gateway.
